@startuml kairos-event-registration-qr-check-in-sequence
title Event Registration and QR Check-in

actor Member
participant "Member App" as App
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> App: View Events Calendar
App -> API: GET /events?upcoming=true
API -> DB: SELECT events
DB --> API: Event list
API --> App: Event list

Member -> App: Open Event Detail\nClick "Register"
App -> API: POST /events/{eventId}/registrations
API -> DB: Insert EventRegistration\n(memberId, eventId, status="Registered")
DB --> API: RegistrationId
API --> App: 201 Created + QR token

App -> Member: Show registration success\n& QR code

' At event date
Member -> App: Open QR code\nor scan from kiosk
App -> API: POST /events/checkin {eventId, qrToken, memberId}
API -> DB: Validate registration + token
DB --> API: OK
API -> DB: Insert EventAttendance\n(memberId, eventId, checked_in_at)
DB --> API: Saved
API --> App: 200 OK (checkedIn=true)

App --> Member: Show "Checked in" confirmation

@enduml
